      "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:22:32.672Z",
      "cooked": "<p>i created an email notification but when it’s triggered, it’s not automatically sent, i find it in email queue but it’s not sent automatically, when i run this command: docker compose exec backend bash -lc ‘bench --site site1.local execute frappe.email.queue.flush’,in frappe docker folder cmd, the mail gets sent and when i check for background jobs using UI, i find it empty, any solution?</p>",
